; ---- bricks: the meals' recipes as a corpus of letters, a separator between two; the most frequent pair of
;      neighbours (neither a separator) merges into a new symbol while the description length drops (greedy MDL,
;      razar/jueces/torrecitas.py): DL = sum c log2(N/c) over the symbols in the corpus + for each merged one in it
;      its letters x log2 9 + log2 N. Relearned from all the meals after each one (bits with 16 of fraction).
